></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Rat: Island Digger is a cozy idle digging game about small progress, quiet satisfaction, and watching a tiny worker do its thing while you focus on whatever else you\u2019re doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clever little rat has arrived on a peaceful tropical island, and beneath the sand lies a whole world waiting to be uncovered. Dig through layers of sand and stone, discover hidden treasures, sell what you find, and slowly turn effort into steady progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to be <strong>always on top of all applications</strong>. It stays visible above everything else on your desktop, so your rat keeps digging while you work, browse, watch videos, or relax. You can freely move and resize the window to fit your perfect setup. This is not just a feature, it is the core experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play actively or let it run quietly in the background. Your rat never stops working.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig at Your Own Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your rat dig automatically, layer by layer. There is no rush, no pressure, and no failure. Just steady progress as the underground slowly reveals its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136410/extras/368a8d71da47fc6b3ca1598f0bec7048.poster.avif?t=1772562654\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136410/extras/368a8d71da47fc6b3ca1598f0bec7048.webm?t=1772562654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136410/extras/368a8d71da47fc6b3ca1598f0bec7048.mp4?t=1772562654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover and Sell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig deeper, you will uncover valuable resources and rare items hidden beneath the island. Everything you dig can be sold to earn coins, which you then use to grow stronger and dig even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136410/extras/21a3c5025865e306d9337ac4d3e25ccd.poster.avif?t=1772562654\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136410/extras/21a3c5025865e306d9337ac4d3e25ccd.webm?t=1772562654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136410/extras/21a3c5025865e306d9337ac4d3e25ccd.mp4?t=1772562654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Upgrade System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your progress with <strong>6 different upgrades</strong>, each changing how your rat works underground:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136410/extras/b86d05e39b9972e15fbc182ddb2b61a2.poster.avif?t=1772562654\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136410/extras/b86d05e39b9972e15fbc182ddb2b61a2.webm?t=1772562654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136410/extras/b86d05e39b9972e15fbc182ddb2b61a2.mp4?t=1772562654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Speed</strong><br>Dig faster and reach deeper layers more quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf40 <strong>Luck</strong><br>Increase your chances of finding rare and valuable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude34 <strong>Rest Time</strong><br>Reduce downtime so your rat gets back to digging sooner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Sell Bonus</strong><br>Earn more coins from every item you sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf92 <strong>Inventory Capacity</strong><br>Carry more items before needing to sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Auto Sell</strong><br>Automatically sell items to keep progress flowing smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each upgrade pushes you deeper and makes the idle loop more satisfying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Cozy Setup</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Rat is not just about numbers. You can personalize your little island by purchasing and equipping different skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc00 <strong>Character Skins</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your rat\u2019s appearance by purchasing and equipping different skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136410/extras/7623db74e85f2bd7cc06affa8d28c43d.poster.avif?t=1772562654\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136410/extras/7623db74e85f2bd7cc06affa8d28c43d.webm?t=1772562654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136410/extras/7623db74e85f2bd7cc06affa8d28c43d.mp4?t=1772562654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u26fa <strong>Tents</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and switch between different tent designs to customize your island.<br>\ud83e\ude91 <strong>Chairs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace your chair with cozy alternatives to complete your setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136410/extras/b7e